# Build-output target for the React SPA (ADR-0019).
#
# `data_governance.api._UI_DIR` points here. In the container image the
# Containerfile's Node build stage copies Vite's `dist/` into this directory
# (index.html + assets/). In source control the directory is intentionally
# empty except this file — the built assets are generated, never committed.
# See data-governance/ui/ for the React source.
